      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s second‑oldest co‑educational school, Atkinson Academy, opened in 1787 as a boys’ school and began admitting girls in 1791.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
