      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2011, the New Hampshire Scenic and Cultural Byways program designated 3.74 miles of Main Street as the “Stage Coach Byway.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
