      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atkinson%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Atkinson celebrated its 250th anniversary on Labor Day weekend in 2017, marking a quarter‑century of continuous community life.",
